{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27129","headline":"湘汉旅怀翁杰 · 周贺","name":"湘汉旅怀翁杰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一宿空江听急流，仍同贾客坐归舟。\n远书来隔巴陵雨，衰鬓去经彭蠡秋。\n不拟爲身谋旧业，终期断谷隐高丘。\n吾宗尚无憀者，中夜闲吟生旅愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}